참조: [Data Visualization with ggplot2::Cheat Sheet "Position Adjustment"](https://rstudio.github.io/cheatsheets/html/data-visualization.html#position-adjustments)

#### 개요

위치 조정은 같은 위치를 차지하는 geom을 어떻게 조정하여 표시할지를 지정한다


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(ggplot2)
e <- ggplot(mpg, aes(cty, hwy, label = cyl))
s <- ggplot(mpg, aes(fl, fill = drv))
```
:::


#### 위치 조정 방법

##### 나란히 배치


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
s + geom_bar(position = "dodge")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplor2-position_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### 위로 채우기 (높이 평준화)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
s + geom_bar(position = "fill")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplor2-position_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



##### 비켜서 배치


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_point(position = "jitter")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplor2-position_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



##### 레이블을 밀어서 조정


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_label(position = "nudge")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplor2-position_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



##### 위로 쌓기


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
s + geom_bar(position = "stack")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplor2-position_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



##### 위치 조정 재정리(recast)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
s + geom_bar(position = position_dodge(width = 1))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplor2-position_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-7-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::
